{"slug":"Rooms-and-Doors-(Hidden-and-Tactics)-remake-of-an-old-script-by-cat_da_scripter-227277","_id":"6aa069210f35076d0d0b627e","title":"remake of an old script for RnD by cat_da_scripter","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c7862a","gameId":5865058321,"name":"Rooms & Doors (Hidden & Tactics)","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-e6484f24a7830bf54ec71c66cd365381-f91b0089059c.png","placeId":5865058321},"features":"ChaosRooms\nIS NOT OPEN SOURCE ANYMORE, SORRY\n\nsooo yeah i made an remake of an cool script that was made 2 years ago, tested only on Real Executor so CYA (Cover Your Ass)\nBE CAREFUL USING IT\n\n    Key Features:\n\nBattery ESP: Automatically detects and highlights batteries through walls. (basically same as that old script)\n\nMonster Notifier: Audio alerts and on-screen warnings whenever entities spawn (A-60, A-120, pnevma, etc.) complete with hiding instructions. (same as battery esp)\n\nMonster ESP, do i need to explain?\n\nFake Light: Attaches a local light source directly to the player character.\n\nCustom Speed: Speed adjustments (16 / 22 / 28) bypassing standard walkspeed limits.\n\n    Controls & Interface:\n\nDraggable panel (click and hold the ChaosDev title to move it anywhere on screen).\n\nSmooth mouse unlock by holding the LeftAlt key.\n\nHotkeys (F1–F7) for quick toggling during gameplay.\n\nBuilt-in self-test system on startup.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Xahlel/iguess/refs/heads/main/chaosRooms%201.8.5.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a5a2976fd118704aa385c3c","username":"ChaosDev","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a5a2976fd118704aa385c3c-1790447463752.jpg","status":"offline","id":"6a5a2976fd118704aa385c3c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1}},"verified":false,"views":1673,"executes":4273,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/5865058321-1788898045939.jpg","likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09